PATCH SCOPE
===========

Patch scope:

- Add one active EvidenceItem.kind enum value for Fractal DAG executor evidence.
- Sync the schema package reference with the active enum result.
- Add a compact invariant stating EvidenceItem.kind is local evidence
  classification only.
- Add focused tests around ResultProposal schema validation and authority
  guardrails.

The patch does not modify runtime emitters, Post V&V behavior, GT, Root, DRS,
Transition Matrix, DRS lifecycle, NeedleRuntime evidence shape, or artifact_type
vocabulary.


